        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Which pipeline is better, by how much, at what cost.** Score: word error rate (WER), the share of words a pipeline gets wrong, misses or adds, against text written by people; averaged over five public test sets. Lower is better. Each stack shows the pipeline it will run."
      }
