    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "The three pipelines to compare",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 13,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**1. Whisper large v3 live**: where the EU stack started. Whisper writes the text in 30 second pieces while people talk.\n\n**2. Whisper large v3 + GLM merge**: the EU stack now. After the conversation Whisper transcribes the whole recording again in one-minute pieces cut at pauses, listens again where it looks lost (wrong language, too few words, silence where someone talked), and GLM fixes names and terms inside each sentence.\n\n**3. Gemini 3.8 live + merge**: the GCP stack. Gemini writes the live text, then transcribes the whole recording again after the conversation. A retry does not pay for Gemini.\n\nThe chart shows WER (%) against text written by people. Price per audio hour and every other variant are in the table below."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "WER (%) per test set, the three pipelines",
      "description": "Lower is better. Text checked by people is the reference.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 13,
        "w": 15,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "postgres",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "rawSql": "select dataset_label as \"Test set\",\nmax(case when pipeline = 'Whisper large v3 live' then wer_to_reference * 100 end) as \"Whisper large v3 live\",\nmax(case when pipeline = 'Whisper large v3 + GLM merge' then wer_to_reference * 100 end) as \"Whisper large v3 + GLM merge\",\nmax(case when pipeline = 'Gemini 3.8 live + merge' then wer_to_reference * 100 end) as \"Gemini 3.8 live + merge\"\nfrom obs.transcription_latest where human_text and pipeline is not null group by dataset_label order by 1",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "xField": "Test set",
        "legend": {
